{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Check Inn</strong> is an easy-to-learn strategy game where you build hotels and serve as many guests as possible. Build different rooms, purchase and upgrade elevators, add service rooms - <strong>all to keep your guests happy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Demo</strong> contains <strong>the first level</strong>, which includes <strong>Tutorial</strong>. You will have to build a budget hotel in <strong>Kansas</strong>. In addition to checking in the guests in the rooms they want, you need to hire new staff and build <strong>service rooms</strong>: kitchens, saunas and laundries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time required to complete: approximately one hour.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2963670?t=1744398635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2963670?t=1744398635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744398635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744398635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Check Inn</strong> is an easy-to-learn strategy game where you build hotels and serve as many guests as possible. Build different rooms, purchase and upgrade elevators, add service rooms - <strong>all to keep your guests happy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Demo</strong> contains <strong>the first level</strong>, which includes <strong>Tutorial</strong>. You will have to build a budget hotel in <strong>Kansas</strong>. In addition to checking in the guests in the rooms they want, you need to hire new staff and build <strong>service rooms</strong>: kitchens, saunas and lau